  "id": "figural-fluency-test",
  "term": "figural fluency test",
  "definition": "A figural fluency test is a measure of nonverbal fluency that evaluates how many different designs a person can produce. Performance can be described by the number of unique designs made and by perseverative errors, meaning repeated designs.",
